  "wiki": {
    "extract": "Tracey Robert Mann is an American businessman and politician who has served as the U.S. representative from Kansas's 1st congressional district since 2021. The district, popularly known as \"the Big First,\" includes parts of 63 counties in central and western Kansas and is the seventh-largest district in the nation that does not cover an entire state.",
